            "review_title": "Review at Docker Natura",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nGreat Spot for Morning Pho\nNov 2018 • Solo\nOK, so I know that this place is more geared toward being a bar in the English pub style but I've been most attracted by the morning pho. Regardless of what a previous poster stated, this place is not far from the main roads. It's quite easy to get to. I run by every morning (with my dogs) and get to enjoy the incredible aroma of chicken pho. I finally got to enjoy a bowl of my own. If the air quality is good enough (and it's not raining), there are some lakefront tables which offer an unparalleled view of West Lake and the city. There are also covered, but outside tables on the restaurant side of the street. I've actually never been inside!! I've only eaten at the outside tables. If you just order pho, you'll get white meat chicken. You also have the option to pay 5000 dong more (25 US cents) for dark meat. This place is great! And, although they're going for the pub look, it's very much a local destination at least in the morning. It's not an expat magnet.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 20, 2018",
